; =============================================================================
; BIND DNS Zone File for: loulouandluxe.com (LouLou & Luxe)
; Registrar: Hostinger (Active Nameservers: nova.dns-parking.com / cosmos.dns-parking.com)
; Target Hostinger KVM2 VPS IPv4: 72.61.243.31
; How to Use:
;   - Option A (Hostinger hPanel): Domains -> loulouandluxe.com -> DNS / Nameservers -> Import Zone
;   - Option B (Cloudflare Dashboard): DNS -> Records -> Import and Export -> Upload File
;   - Option C (Automated CLI): Run ./scripts/provision-loulouandluxe-subdomains.sh
; =============================================================================

$ORIGIN loulouandluxe.com.
$TTL 300

; --- 1. Root Storefront & Canonical WWW Subdomain ----------------------------
; Serves USA + Canada (US_CA) at https://loulouandluxe.com/ and /ca/
; Serves UK (/uk/), Australia (/au/), Germany (/de/), Singapore (/sg/) via subfolders
@                       IN  A       72.61.243.31
www                     IN  CNAME   loulouandluxe.com.

; --- 2. Core Commerce & Backend Infrastructure Subdomains --------------------
; Headless Medusa.js v2 Commerce API + Banana POD & Multi-Website Manager Sync API
api                     IN  A       72.61.243.31

; n8n Webhook & Queue Orchestrator (2-Hour Order Hold, Printify Dispatch, Refund Engine)
hooks                   IN  A       72.61.243.31

; Chatwoot Customer Support Helpdesk & Live Storefront Chat Widget
support                 IN  A       72.61.243.31

; Uptime & Health Check Status Endpoint (Monitored by Multi-Website Manager)
status                  IN  A       72.61.243.31

; --- 3. CDN & First-Party Ad Tracking Subdomains -----------------------------
; Cloudflare R2 Custom Domain for 800x800 WebP Regional Lookbooks & 300-DPI Print Previews
cdn                     IN  CNAME   public.r2.cloudflarestorage.com.

; First-Party Server-Side Tracking Gateway (Meta CAPI + Pinterest CAPI + GA4 sGTM)
; Bypasses iOS 17+ Safari ITP and browser ad-blockers via 1st-party cookies
track                   IN  A       72.61.243.31

; --- 4. Transactional Email Subdomain (send.loulouandluxe.com via Resend/Brevo)
; Isolates automated order/shipping emails (orders@loulouandluxe.com) on send.loulouandluxe.com
; so root @loulouandluxe.com email routing stays clean for loulouandluxe@gmail.com
send                    IN  MX  10  feedback-smtp.us-east-1.amazonses.com.
send                    IN  TXT     "v=spf1 include:amazonses.com ~all"
resend._domainkey       IN  TXT     "p=REPLACE_WITH_RESEND_DKIM_PUBLIC_KEY"

; --- 5. Root Email Forwarding & DMARC Brand Protection -----------------------
; Root SPF & DMARC Policy (Protects @loulouandluxe.com from email spoofing)
@                       IN  TXT     "v=spf1 include:_spf.mail.hostinger.com include:_spf.mx.cloudflare.net ~all"
_dmarc                  IN  TXT     "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; rua=mailto:loulouandluxe@gmail.com; pct=100; adkim=s; aspf=s"

; --- 6. Social & Ad Platform Domain Verification TXT Placeholders ------------
; Meta Business Manager Domain Verification (Required for Rule #5 & Conversions API)
@                       IN  TXT     "facebook-domain-verification=REPLACE_WITH_META_BUSINESS_TOKEN"
; Pinterest Business Domain Claim Verification
@                       IN  TXT     "pinterest-site-verification=REPLACE_WITH_PINTEREST_TOKEN"
; Google Search Console & Merchant Center Verification
@                       IN  TXT     "google-site-verification=REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_TOKEN"
